{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "e4fcb864-1e9f-4d39-bae4-f8644391aaa5",
    "name": "Space Bounty Hunters API",
    "description": "Midterm practical assignment — Web Application Development (KBTU, Fall 2026).\n\nDjango 5.2 + Django REST Framework + PostgreSQL. Set `base_url` (default `http://localhost:8000`) and run the folders top to bottom — the hunt-log CRUD requests chain through the `hunt_id` variable.\n\nFolders: 1) criminals listing, filtering (`min_reward`, `max_reward`, `armed`, `has_crew`, `escape_master`) and sorting (`sort=reward|-reward`), details; 2) full CRUD of hunt logs; 3) invalid requests (404 / 400 / 405).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
